I used to play Angband and I really liked the monster memory feature.
Basically what it does is it remembers what monsters you have
encountered and gives you information about them that you have found
out (how they attack, speed, etc.) Maybe add what happens after you
eat them. I think this would go well with NetHack.

Second, how about making a command like Moria's R* command. That makes
you rest until you are fully healed and have full mana, and is
automatically interrupted if a hostile monster comes within view.

